{
  "id": "the-simpsons---4x20---whacking-dayen",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 4x20 - Whacking Day.en",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 4x20 - Whacking Day.en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-08-31T04:14:29.517Z",
  "lineCount": 296,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "[Chorus] ## The Simpsons ##",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 2200,
      "endMs": 6000
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "[Bell Ringing]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 8173,
      "endMs": 10368
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "[Whistle Blowing]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 11943,
      "endMs": 14241
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "[ Beeping ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 18650,
      "endMs": 20550
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "## [Jazzy Solo ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 25557,
      "endMs": 30017
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "D'oh! [ Screams ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 35066,
      "endMs": 37000
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "[ Tires Screeching ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 37102,
      "endMs": 38660
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "[Children Chattering]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 53985,
      "endMs": 56920
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Children, we've just been tipped off that Superintendent Chalmers... is planning a surprise inspection.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 57022,
      "endMs": 61718
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "So, let's clean up this pigsty.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 61826,
      "endMs": 63316
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Whoa! [ Screeches ] On another topic, the following students have won mountain bikes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 65096,
      "endMs": 71998
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Bart Simpson, Jimbo Jones...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 72103,
      "endMs": 75072
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Nelson Muntz.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 75173,
      "endMs": 77141
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "I want you to keep filling your shirt with crud till I get back.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 77242,
      "endMs": 81508
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Y-Yes, sir.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 81613,
      "endMs": 83513
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "You may pick your bikes up in utility basement \"B.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 85150,
      "endMs": 89780
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Fools. [ Evil Laugh ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 89888,
      "endMs": 92448
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "[Laughter Continues]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 92557,
      "endMs": 95025
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Oops. Still on. -[Shuts Off] Hey, what do you think he meant by that \"fools\" remark?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 98630,
      "endMs": 105636
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "Aw, who cares? Time to get me a mountain bike.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 105737,
      "endMs": 108262
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "Hey, what gives? Where are the mountain bikes?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 113812,
      "endMs": 117578
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "Sorry about the ruse, gentlemen. [ Grunts ] You're being swept under the rug for the superintendent's visit.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 117682,
      "endMs": 123084
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "Enjoy. [Lock Clicks] How are we gonna get out of here?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 123188,
      "endMs": 127991
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "And when are we gonna get our mountain bikes?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 128093,
      "endMs": 130459
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "Would the world judge me harshly if I threw away the key?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 130562,
      "endMs": 133531
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "No, but the P.T.A. would tear you a new arse.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 133631,
      "endMs": 136930
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "Wise counsel, William. But the potty-talk adds nothing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 137035,
      "endMs": 139595
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "Aye, sir. You bath-taking, underpants-wearing lily hugger.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 139704,
      "endMs": 143538
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "[ Tires Screech ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 143641,
      "endMs": 145108
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "[ Slurping, Grunting ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 146811,
      "endMs": 149644
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "Superintendent Chalmers, welcome.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 150749,
      "endMs": 152717
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "Hello, Seymour. - So, what's the word down at One School Board Plaza?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 152817,
      "endMs": 156947
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "We're dropping the geography requirement.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 157055,
      "endMs": 158955
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "The children weren't testing well. It was proving to be an embarrassment.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 159057,
      "endMs": 161685
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "Very good. Back to the three \"R's.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 161793,
      "endMs": 164489
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "Two \"R's\" come October. Hmm.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 164596,
      "endMs": 166723
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "What do you think of the banners? Transparent toadying.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 166831,
      "endMs": 169994
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "They were the children's idea. I tried to stop them.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 170101,
      "endMs": 173298
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "It's always the children's fault, isn't it, Seymour?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 173405,
      "endMs": 176272
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "Yes. Yes, it is, sir.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 176374,
      "endMs": 177966
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "Imagine-- a school out there with no bullies.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 178076,
      "endMs": 182376
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "Science geeks not getting beat up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 182480,
      "endMs": 184812
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "Kids using their lunch money for food.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 184916,
      "endMs": 187544
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "I can't take it! [ Grunts ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 187652,
      "endMs": 190120
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Hey, I think I can squeeze through that vent.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 194192,
      "endMs": 196319
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "All right. All right, Bart. Do it, man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 196428,
      "endMs": 198726
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "[ Grunts ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 203735,
      "endMs": 205635
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "Now, remember, little dude, you're our only hope.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 207172,
      "endMs": 211632
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "[ Grunt ] [Bart]Ow!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 211743,
      "endMs": 213643
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "Got 'im! Way to go, man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 213745,
      "endMs": 216908
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "May I interest you in a Jell-O brick, sir? There's a grape in the center.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 217015,
      "endMs": 220815
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "Well, I'm not made of stone. [ Laughs ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 220919,
      "endMs": 223888
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "You're not made of stone. [ Chuckles ] A brick and you're not made of... stone.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 223988,
      "endMs": 229849
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "[ Engine Sputtering ] Ach, my beauty.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 229961,
      "endMs": 232293
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "Wait till the superintendent sees you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 232397,
      "endMs": 235525
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "Were it not a violation of God's law, I'd make you my wife.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 235633,
      "endMs": 239364
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "[ Loud Kiss ] Now thar's a lonely man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 239471,
      "endMs": 242167
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "[ Gulps ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 244275,
      "endMs": 246175
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "I'm new in town. Be there a cool loch... where a lass could wash her long, red hair?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 248346,
      "endMs": 254646
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "Nay, but there's a pool at me apartment complex. There was a rat in the deep end.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 254752,
      "endMs": 259917
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "But we got 'im! Ah, lead on.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 260024,
      "endMs": 264825
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "Forty-eight, 49, 50.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 264929,
      "endMs": 268558
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "Flag's up-to-date. Very good, Seymour.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 268666,
      "endMs": 271533
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "Now, are these children as smart as they look?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 271636,
      "endMs": 273763
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "Well, let's, uh, pick one at random. Mmm, how about that one?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 273872,
      "endMs": 277501
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "You mean this boy here? No! No. Lisa Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 277609,
      "endMs": 280169
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "When was the Battle of New Orleans? -January 8, 1 81 5.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 280278,
      "endMs": 284146
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "Two weeks after the war ended.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 284249,
      "endMs": 286376
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "First-rate. What's a battle?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 286484,
      "endMs": 288952
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "[ Forced Laughter] Let's go.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 289053,
      "endMs": 291578
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "Did that boy say, \"What's a battle?\" He said, \"What's that rattle?\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 291689,
      "endMs": 294453
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "About the heating duct. Hmm. It sounded like battle.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 294559,
      "endMs": 297687
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "I've had a cold, so, uh-- Oh, so you would hear \"R's\" as \"B's?\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 297795,
      "endMs": 301322
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "Yes. I understand.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 301432,
      "endMs": 303127
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "[Engine Sputtering]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 303234,
      "endMs": 305532
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "Come on, Bart. Ride me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 311042,
      "endMs": 313772
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "I better not. [ Imitating Chicken ] He's insulting both of us.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 315813,
      "endMs": 321751
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "Let's go.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 323655,
      "endMs": 326146
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "[ Yells ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 327425,
      "endMs": 329120
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "Excellent. Not a trace of urine. Seymour, you run a tight ship.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 339404,
      "endMs": 343135
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "Well, you know what they say, sir. \"Where there's no smoke, there's no fire.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 343241,
      "endMs": 347200
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "What an odd remark. Why, that looks like a 50-cent piece.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 347312,
      "endMs": 350281
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "I'll just bend over and get it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 350381,
      "endMs": 352941
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "[ Yelling ] Seems to be caught...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 353051,
      "endMs": 356316
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "between these two flowers. [ Yells ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 356421,
      "endMs": 358946
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "[ Yells ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 359057,
      "endMs": 360684
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "Ow, ow, ow. Seymour, I was thinking of promoting you to assistant superintendent.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 362560,
      "endMs": 367793
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "But, instead, that plum goes to Holloway.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 367899,
      "endMs": 370697
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "No. But, sir, he's a drunk. And a pill-popper.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 370802,
      "endMs": 373032
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "If I could just-- Silence!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 373137,
      "endMs": 374695
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "And why is a cafeteria worker posing as a nurse?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 374806,
      "endMs": 378264
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "I get two paychecks this way. D'oh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 378376,
      "endMs": 381209
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "There's no detention this time, Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 382347,
      "endMs": 384440
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "This is the end.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 384549,
      "endMs": 386449
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "You are expelled from Springfield Elementary.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 386551,
      "endMs": 391352
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "[ Laughing ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 391456,
      "endMs": 393617
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "[ Maniacal Laughter]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 393725,
      "endMs": 396956
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "Aw.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 397061,
      "endMs": 398494
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Tonight on Eye On Springfield, the Munchkins from The Wizard of Oz.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 401899,
      "endMs": 405699
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "Where are they now?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 405803,
      "endMs": 409295
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "And we'll visit a nudist camp... for animals.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 409407,
      "endMs": 412399
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "But, first, a look at the local holiday that was called... distasteful and puerile by a panel of hillbillies, \"Whacking Day.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 412510,
      "endMs": 420741
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "Oh, no, no! In a tradition that dates back to... founding father Jebediah Springfield, every May 1 0, local residents gather... to drive snakes into the center of town and whack them to snake heaven.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 420852,
      "endMs": 432727
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "[ Grunting ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 432830,
      "endMs": 434422
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "After exposing Alger Hiss...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 438036,
      "endMs": 440834
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "Honorary Grand Marshal Richard Nixon... goes after another deadly hiss.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 440938,
      "endMs": 446802
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "Oh! [ Grunts ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 446911,
      "endMs": 450472
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "I-Is Whacking Day over? [Jeering ] Thank you. Thanks for coming out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 450581,
      "endMs": 457817
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "[ Groans ] It's all so barbaric.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 457922,
      "endMs": 460891
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Hey, kids, how was school?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 460992,
      "endMs": 462584
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "I learned how many drams in a pennyweight. I got expelled.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 462694,
      "endMs": 465993
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "That's my boy. [ Gulping ] Mmm, beer. What?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 466097,
      "endMs": 471134
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "Look, Dad, I don't need school.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 471235,
      "endMs": 473362
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "I'll make my way as a bootblack. Shine your boots, guv'nor?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 473471,
      "endMs": 476929
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "No son of mine is gonna be a 1 9th-century cockney bootblack.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 477041,
      "endMs": 480169
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "We're gonna find you another school.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 480278,
      "endMs": 482178
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "Now, remember, Bart. This is a religious school...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 487452,
      "endMs": 490148
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "so be very careful about what you say and do here. No problemo.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 490254,
      "endMs": 493485
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "Now, Bart, Since you're new here... perhaps you'd favor us with a psalm.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 493591,
      "endMs": 498294
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "How about \"Beans, beans, the musical fruit\"?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 498396,
      "endMs": 502332
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "Well, uh, beans were a staple of the Israelites. Yes, proceed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 502433,
      "endMs": 506233
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "[ Clears Throat ] Beans, beans, the musical fruit.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 507772,
      "endMs": 510138
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "The more you eat, the more you toot.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 510241,
      "endMs": 512402
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "[ Grunts ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 512510,
      "endMs": 515001
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "## [ Humming ] Avert your eyes, children. He may take on other forms.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 515113,
      "endMs": 523118
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "I guess that's it. I just can't be educated.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 523221,
      "endMs": 526349
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "[ Loud Sigh ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 526457,
      "endMs": 528925
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "I can always get a job testing dangerous food additives.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 529026,
      "endMs": 532655
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "We'd like you to try this new diet cola.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 532764,
      "endMs": 535392
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "We call it \"Nature's Goodness.\" What's in it?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 535500,
      "endMs": 537968
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "2-4 desoxypropenuramine.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 538069,
      "endMs": 539969
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "[ Burps ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 544142,
      "endMs": 546042
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "[ Grunting ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 547178,
      "endMs": 549976
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "Sweet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 550081,
      "endMs": 551981
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "Pleasing taste. Some \"monsterism.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 552083,
      "endMs": 554881
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "Cool. You're going to get an education.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 556254,
      "endMs": 559690
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "I'm going to teach you myself. Marge, it's too late.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 559791,
      "endMs": 563227
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "The boy's 1 0 years old. Let's focus our energy on Lisa and the other one.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 563327,
      "endMs": 568287
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "What's your problem? Whacking Day's coming.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 568399,
      "endMs": 570993
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "Whoo-hoo! The greatest day of the year.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 571102,
      "endMs": 573366
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "But killing snakes is evil.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 573471,
      "endMs": 575530
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "Maybe so, Lisa, but it's part of our oh, so human nature.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 575640,
      "endMs": 580202
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "Inside every man is a struggle between good and evil that cannot be resolved.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 580311,
      "endMs": 584441
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "[ Singsongy] I am evil Homer. I am evil Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 586751,
      "endMs": 589914
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "I am evil Homer. I am evil Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 590021,
      "endMs": 593787
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "Have a nice day at school, Lise. I'll just try and make the best of a bad situation.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 599130,
      "endMs": 602827
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "[ Grunts ] Ahh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 602934,
      "endMs": 607564
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "Bart, get dressed for school. I expect you to be in your seat when the bell rings.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 607672,
      "endMs": 611267
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "[ Chuckling ] I bought a bell.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 612910,
      "endMs": 616073
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "[ Ringing Shrilly] [ Both Scream ] I think I'll unplug that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 622086,
      "endMs": 626722
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "I'm your new teacher. My name is Mrs. Simpson. [ Chuckles ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 629260,
      "endMs": 633560
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "[ Forced Chuckle, Groans ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 633664,
      "endMs": 636599
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "[ Ticking Loudly]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 636701,
      "endMs": 639397
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "[ Imitates Flatulence ] [ Blows Raspberry]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 644308,
      "endMs": 646367
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "I didn't do it. [ Groans ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 650047,
      "endMs": 653175
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "[Knocking] Oh, that's right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 654886,
      "endMs": 656854
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "I invited a guest speaker to talk to the class.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 656954,
      "endMs": 659946
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "Hello, children.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 660057,
      "endMs": 662082
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "I got separated from my platoon after we parachuted into D�sseldorf.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 662193,
      "endMs": 667153
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "####[Cabaret] So I rode out the war posing as a German cabaret singer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 667265,
      "endMs": 676570
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "## [ Cabaret ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 676674,
      "endMs": 679973
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "Yoo-hoo.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 682046,
      "endMs": 683946
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "[ Gasps ] Ach du Liebe! Das ist not eine booby.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 690421,
      "endMs": 693549
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "Is that story true, Grampa? Well, most of it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 693658,
      "endMs": 697458
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "I did wear a dress for a period in the '40s.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 697562,
      "endMs": 700190
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "Oh, they had designers then. [ Garage Door Opening ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 700298,
      "endMs": 703267
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "[ All Screaming ] [ Screaming ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 703367,
      "endMs": 705460
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "Look what I got, Marge. A new whacking stick.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 708306,
      "endMs": 712265
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "Whack! Ooh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 712376,
      "endMs": 714844
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "Excuse me. Whack, whack, whack!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 714946,
      "endMs": 717779
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "Whoa, whoa, whoa!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 717882,
      "endMs": 719850
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "Bart, I'd like you to read this copy of Johnny Tremain.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 719951,
      "endMs": 723717
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "It's a book I read as a girl. A book? [ Blows Raspberry] I think you might like this. It's about a boy who goes to war.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 723821,
      "endMs": 730751
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "His hand is deformed in an accident. Deformed?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 730861,
      "endMs": 733523
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "Why didn't you say so? They should call this book \"Johnny Deformed.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 733631,
      "endMs": 738466
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "####[Cartoon Theme] [Announcer]Guest director, Oliver Stone.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 738569,
      "endMs": 746539
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "[ Gunshot ] [ Man ] Oh, God! Get his gun!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 750715,
      "endMs": 753775
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "####[Cartoon Theme] \"Hundreds would die, but not the thing they died for.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 753884,
      "endMs": 760148
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "A man can stand up.\" Wow!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 760257,
      "endMs": 764694
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. If you'd like to learn more about colonial times... we could take a field trip to Olde Springfield Towne.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 764795,
      "endMs": 771193
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "[ Both Scream ] [ Screams ] D'oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 772303,
      "endMs": 777234
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "[ Grunting ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 778876,
      "endMs": 781174
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "Hi-yah! [ Yells ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 788085,
      "endMs": 790781
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "Dad! Everyone likes Whacking Day, but I hate it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 795159,
      "endMs": 799459
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "Is there something wrong with me? Yes, honey.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 799563,
      "endMs": 802361
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "Then what should I do? -Just squeeze your rage into a bitter little ball... and release it at an appropriate time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 802466,
      "endMs": 809832
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "Like that day I hit the referee with a whiskey bottle.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 809940,
      "endMs": 812408
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "Remember that? Yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 812510,
      "endMs": 814171
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "When Daddy hit the referee? Yeah. Yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 814278,
      "endMs": 816542
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "Any experience? Yes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 822586,
      "endMs": 824315
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "I played Panicky Idiot Number Two in The Poseidon Adventure.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 824422,
      "endMs": 827653
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "Sorry, we're looking for more of a \"duh, duh\" idiot.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 827758,
      "endMs": 831717
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "But-- I see.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 831829,
      "endMs": 834798
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "[ Groans ] Hello, Barney. Are you playing the town drunk?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 834899,
      "endMs": 839063
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "Actually, I'm supposed to be a governor. [ Burps ] The enemy surrounded the fort and said that if the captain was sent out...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 839170,
      "endMs": 846968
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "the rest would be spared. What did they do?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 847078,
      "endMs": 849740
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "They sent him out. Was he killed?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 849847,
      "endMs": 851838
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "And how. That's why they call it Fort Sensible.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 851949,
      "endMs": 856283
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "[Projector Clicks] - This is Jebediah Springfield at the Battle of Ticonderoga.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 856387,
      "endMs": 861586
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "Next. And here he is killing a snake... on the very first Whacking Day in 1775.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 861692,
      "endMs": 868854
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "Hey, wait a minute.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 868966,
      "endMs": 870900
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "That was the same day he was at Ticonderoga.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 871001,
      "endMs": 873663
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "How could he be in two places at once?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 873771,
      "endMs": 876001
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "Uh, um-- You see--",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 876107,
      "endMs": 879508
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "He'll blow the whole deal. Get him out of here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 882446,
      "endMs": 884914
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "Roger.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 885015,
      "endMs": 886983
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "[ Both Gasp ] If you wanna learn more about Whacking Day... there are many fine books in our gift shop.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 887084,
      "endMs": 892154
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "Welcome to your official Whacking Day headquarters.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 892256,
      "endMs": 895657
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "I've hidden a snake somewhere in the store.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 895760,
      "endMs": 898490
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "The first one to whack it, gets a free Squishy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 898596,
      "endMs": 901588
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "[People Yelling]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 901699,
      "endMs": 904065
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "Hey! Hey! [ Yelling ] I should've put more thought into my promotion.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 906637,
      "endMs": 911770
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "Aim for the body, men. Right, Chief.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 911876,
      "endMs": 915368
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "\"And the Lord said, \"Whackye all the serpents which crawl on their bellies... and thy town shall be a beacon unto others.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 917481,
      "endMs": 926889
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "So you see, Lisa, even God himself endorses Whacking Day.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 928259,
      "endMs": 932286
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "Let me see that. Mmm, no.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 932396,
      "endMs": 935388
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "####[Children Singing]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 939703,
      "endMs": 944163
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "Here you go. Official Whacking Day parking. Ten dollars per axle.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 966764,
      "endMs": 972100
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "Whoo-hoo! [ Exclaiming ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 976273,
      "endMs": 978741
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "Take that snake! [ Grunts ] And you too!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 980511,
      "endMs": 983810
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "Snakes, snakes everywhere.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 983914,
      "endMs": 986212
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "Getting ready for Whacking Day? What's Whacking Day?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 986317,
      "endMs": 989514
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "Did you bring the pre-whacked snakes?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 995626,
      "endMs": 998254
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "Beautiful.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 999563,
      "endMs": 1001292
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "Well, Marge, should I whack slow or fast?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1005035,
      "endMs": 1008471
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "Slow, then fast.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1008572,
      "endMs": 1012030
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "[ Both Laugh ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1012142,
      "endMs": 1014042
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "Uh-oh. Dad, please.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1014144,
      "endMs": 1016237
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "For the last time, I beg you. Don't lower yourself to the level of the mob.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1016347,
      "endMs": 1021250
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "Lisa, maybe if I'm part of that mob, I can help steer it in wise directions.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1021352,
      "endMs": 1026984
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "Now, where's my giant foam cowboy hat and air horn?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1027091,
      "endMs": 1029651
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "[ Loud Beep ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1030895,
      "endMs": 1033664
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "[ Loud Beep ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1033664,
      "endMs": 1034528
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "And now to open This year's festivities... here's our grand marshal, the Prophet of Love, Larry White.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1034632,
      "endMs": 1042362
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "Barry White. No. It says here Larry White.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1042473,
      "endMs": 1045271
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "I know my own name. Yeah? Well, we'll see.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1045376,
      "endMs": 1048937
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "[Crowd Cheering]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1049046,
      "endMs": 1051173
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "Ladies and gentlemen, my unlimited love to y'all.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1051282,
      "endMs": 1054911
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "It's truly an honor to be here at this-- Hey, what is this all about anyway?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1055019,
      "endMs": 1060389
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "[ Whispering, Indistinct ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1060491,
      "endMs": 1062459
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "Oh, God, no. You people make me sick.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1062559,
      "endMs": 1065585
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "[ Cheering ] Were they even listening to me?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1065696,
      "endMs": 1069655
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "I, uh, don't think so.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1069767,
      "endMs": 1071894
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "And now, let's hear it for our own Miss Springfield.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1072002,
      "endMs": 1075836
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "Gentlemen, start your whacking.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1075940,
      "endMs": 1078738
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "[ Clamoring ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1079343,
      "endMs": 1082278
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "D'oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1091889,
      "endMs": 1093914
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "[Buzzing]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1095592,
      "endMs": 1098618
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "Ew, a bug. [ Screams ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1098729,
      "endMs": 1101698
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "If the snakes were in here, we could protect them.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1106637,
      "endMs": 1108935
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "Well, according to this, snakes hear by sensing vibrations in the ground.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1109039,
      "endMs": 1114136
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "So, if we put our stereo speakers on the ground... and play something with a lot of bass... those snakes will be in here like Oprah on a baked ham.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1114244,
      "endMs": 1121878
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "Oh, good idea. Let's see-- bass, bass.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1121986,
      "endMs": 1126286
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "Tiny Tim, The Chipmunks' Greatest Hits, A Castrato Christmas.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1126390,
      "endMs": 1130349
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "[ Frustrated Sigh ] ## [ Singing R & B ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1130461,
      "endMs": 1133760
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "Mr. White! Can we borrow you for a minute?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1136100,
      "endMs": 1138500
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "Anything... for a lady.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1138602,
      "endMs": 1141070
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "## [ R & B ] Don't bother the snakes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1141171,
      "endMs": 1145740
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "Leave all the snakes... alone.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1145843,
      "endMs": 1150507
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "Ah, yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1150614,
      "endMs": 1153082
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "My baby.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1158622,
      "endMs": 1160647
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "## [ R & B ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1160758,
      "endMs": 1164159
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "####[Continues]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1178842,
      "endMs": 1182369
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "[Rumbling]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1183714,
      "endMs": 1186342
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "In here. -####[Continues]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1197895,
      "endMs": 1201353
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
      "text": "[ Clamoring ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1203233,
      "endMs": 1205201
    },
    {
      "index": 266,
      "text": "Hey, where'd all the snakes go?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1207504,
      "endMs": 1209734
    },
    {
      "index": 267,
      "text": "[ Hisses ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1211275,
      "endMs": 1213175
    },
    {
      "index": 268,
      "text": "People of Springfield, Whacking Day is a sham.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1215245,
      "endMs": 1220148
    },
    {
      "index": 269,
      "text": "It was started in 1 924, as an excuse to beat up the Irish.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1220250,
      "endMs": 1223708
    },
    {
      "index": 270,
      "text": "'Tis true. I took many a lump. But 'twas all in good fun.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1223821,
      "endMs": 1228520
    },
    {
      "index": 271,
      "text": "Now, wait a minute!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1228625,
      "endMs": 1230525
    },
    {
      "index": 272,
      "text": "How can you people turn on snakes after all they've done for you?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1230627,
      "endMs": 1233721
    },
    {
      "index": 273,
      "text": "I'm an old man. I hate everything but Matlock. Ooh, it's on now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1233831,
      "endMs": 1238359
    },
    {
      "index": 274,
      "text": "Mrs. Glick, who killed all those rats in your basement?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1238469,
      "endMs": 1241768
    },
    {
      "index": 275,
      "text": "A snake did. And you like snakes, don't you, Barry White?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1241872,
      "endMs": 1245501
    },
    {
      "index": 276,
      "text": "I love the sexy slither ofa lady snake. Oh, baby.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1245609,
      "endMs": 1250410
    },
    {
      "index": 277,
      "text": "[ All ] Hooray for snakes! Hooray for snakes!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1250514,
      "endMs": 1253881
    },
    {
      "index": 278,
      "text": "Look at this everyone. Twelve dead snakes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1253984,
      "endMs": 1256646
    },
    {
      "index": 279,
      "text": "[ All Booing ] I'm sick of you people.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1256753,
      "endMs": 1260712
    },
    {
      "index": 280,
      "text": "You're nothing but a pack of fickle mush-heads.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1260824,
      "endMs": 1262724
    },
    {
      "index": 281,
      "text": "He's right. Give us hell, Quimby.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1262826,
      "endMs": 1265727
    },
    {
      "index": 282,
      "text": "[Crowd Cheering] ####[Man Singing]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1265829,
      "endMs": 1269390
    },
    {
      "index": 283,
      "text": "Bart, I'm very impressed at the independent learning you've displayed here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1279176,
      "endMs": 1283044
    },
    {
      "index": 284,
      "text": "Thanks, Seymour. Ye-- [ Sighs ] Yes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1283147,
      "endMs": 1285479
    },
    {
      "index": 285,
      "text": "Um, anyway, as a reward for your studying...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1285582,
      "endMs": 1287675
    },
    {
      "index": 286,
      "text": "I've decided to welcome you back to our school.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1287784,
      "endMs": 1290480
    },
    {
      "index": 287,
      "text": "You'll be reunited with your chums, Nelson, Jimbo, D-- Oh, dear God!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1290587,
      "endMs": 1295422
    },
    {
      "index": 288,
      "text": "I guess I've always used violence as a way of getting attention.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1295526,
      "endMs": 1299826
    },
    {
      "index": 289,
      "text": "Yes. Yes. Me too.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1299930,
      "endMs": 1302990
    },
    {
      "index": 290,
      "text": "Oh. Aw.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1303100,
      "endMs": 1305000
    },
    {
      "index": 291,
      "text": "Faster, Willie, faster. Now, we give 'em the bikes, no one sues.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1306603,
      "endMs": 1310437
    },
    {
      "index": 292,
      "text": "[ Nervous Chuckle ] [ Chuckles ] What if they're dead, sir?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1310541,
      "endMs": 1314204
    },
    {
      "index": 293,
      "text": "Then we ride these bikes to Mexico and freedom, Willie! Freedom!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1314311,
      "endMs": 1318372
    },
    {
      "index": 294,
      "text": "Freedom. [ Chuckles ] I'll turn you in at the first tollbooth.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1318482,
      "endMs": 1322612
    },
    {
      "index": 295,
      "text": "[ People Chattering ] Shh! www.tvsubtitles.net",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1376106,
      "endMs": 2000
    }
  ]
}
